WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
This custom Navigation block reads shared site fields.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Brand name is a Site Field reference to the source field in Site content.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Editing the reference in the content form updates that source value.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The header and footer now display the same shared brand name.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
The custom Post Content block reads this post’s page fields.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Its Title is a Page Field reference to the Blog Post title field.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Save a new title for this post.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
The listing reads the updated title. The second post keeps its own title.
